WEBVTT

00:02.190 --> 00:05.750
Dang... I finally climbed up the ladder
enough to get a TV appearance.

00:05.750 --> 00:09.630
These greenrooms sure do
make you restless, though.

00:09.630 --> 00:11.570
Reigen-san, you're up.

00:15.730 --> 00:17.240
All right. Let's do this.

00:17.240 --> 00:19.990
Tea

00:17.240 --> 00:19.990
Supernatural Detective!
Do Spiritual Powers Actually Exist!?
Special

01:40.280 --> 01:45.120
Mob Psycho

01:50.000 --> 01:52.000
_______________________________
_______________________________

01:50.000 --> 01:52.000
A boy was possessed by a fox after
playing Kokkuri-san after school!?

01:51.430 --> 01:55.680
Oh, this must be it.
Jodo-sama's return to TV.

01:57.610 --> 01:59.130
R-Reigen?!

01:59.130 --> 02:01.080
What the heck is he doing?

02:01.740 --> 02:04.500
And now... Will we be able to save the poor,

02:03.970 --> 02:07.480
Host

02:03.970 --> 02:07.480
Ebihara Morizo

02:04.500 --> 02:07.480
unfortunate young man that's been possessed?

02:07.850 --> 02:12.200
Let's introduce our two powerful helpers!

02:12.200 --> 02:13.440
The first one needs no introduction.

02:13.440 --> 02:18.150
The president of the Rising Sun
Spiritual Union, Jodo Kirin-sensei!

02:18.150 --> 02:23.280
Jodo Kirin

02:18.290 --> 02:23.280
He's solved devastating problems for many.
He's the best of the best!

02:23.570 --> 02:26.970
The other is making his
first appearance on TV.

02:26.970 --> 02:29.640
Reigen Arataka-sensei!

02:30.930 --> 02:34.020
Why, hello there. I'm Reigen Arataka.

02:34.020 --> 02:36.130
You can find my business in Seasoning City.

02:36.130 --> 02:40.590
Do Spiritual Powers Actually Exist!?

02:36.130 --> 02:40.590
Special!

02:36.390 --> 02:40.590
What are some of your accomplishments up till now, Reigen-sensei?

02:41.570 --> 02:44.010
It's hard to choose just one...

02:44.010 --> 02:46.710
Oh, but I did defeat the Dragger.

02:45.970 --> 02:48.270
Mogi Tatsuya

02:46.710 --> 02:48.270
Huh? That's awesome.

02:48.260 --> 02:51.480
Looks like we can expect great things.

02:51.480 --> 02:54.010
And now, let's bring out the boy.

02:51.480 --> 02:57.940
Spooky

02:54.010 --> 02:57.490
To be extra careful,
since he may freak out,

02:57.490 --> 02:59.680
we have him securely bound.

03:05.370 --> 03:06.330
Go to Reigen-sensei!

03:06.330 --> 03:07.370
Go to Reigen-sensei!

03:07.370 --> 03:09.550
What do you think?

03:09.550 --> 03:10.920
I see...

03:10.920 --> 03:12.220
The footage we just watched

03:12.220 --> 03:17.210

mentioned that he was possessed by a fox
after playing the Kokkuri-san game.

03:17.390 --> 03:18.340
But to be more precise,

03:18.340 --> 03:21.430
it's a ghost of a Rüppell's fox,
which are usually found in North Africa.

03:21.430 --> 03:25.140
What's this? He was able to precisely
deduce the kind of ghost it is!

03:25.480 --> 03:27.760
What do you think, Jodo-sensei?

03:27.760 --> 03:30.350
The poor child...
being strapped down like that.

03:30.350 --> 03:32.910
I'm hoping we don't have to keep
those things on him much longer.

03:32.910 --> 03:36.820
I see. So we all feel the same.

03:37.070 --> 03:41.460
And now, we're finally going to
witness the public exorcism!

03:41.460 --> 03:43.780
But before that,
a word from our sponsors.

03:46.580 --> 03:50.040
When we're back on air, we're going
to have Jodo-sensei do the exorcism.

03:50.040 --> 03:54.430
Actually, why don't we have
Reigen-kun give it a shot?

03:54.430 --> 03:55.080
Wha—

03:55.080 --> 03:57.750
No one wants to see an old man.

03:58.020 --> 04:03.970
Let's show the country how
a next-generation psychic does things.

04:03.970 --> 04:08.060
Wasn't I just supposed to sit
there and comment today?

04:08.360 --> 04:12.130
I'm trying to give you the spotlight here.

04:12.130 --> 04:14.370
But if you're not up to the task, very well.

04:14.370 --> 04:16.020
I'll do it, just as it says in the script.

04:16.440 --> 04:17.400
The script?

04:18.080 --> 04:19.170
I see!

04:19.530 --> 04:22.270
One moment! I'll do it after all.

04:24.130 --> 04:25.810
Okay... sure.

04:25.810 --> 04:28.360
Reigen-sensei's going to
perform the exorcism this time.

04:28.360 --> 04:29.930
We're coming back from commercial!

04:30.790 --> 04:33.750
Supernatural Detective
Special!!

04:32.160 --> 04:37.040
And it looks like we're just about
ready for this public exorcism.

04:37.280 --> 04:39.660
The one performing this exorcism

04:39.660 --> 04:42.870
is an exciting newcomer
who has had a meteoric rise!

04:42.870 --> 04:46.300
Reigen Arataka-sensei! Are you ready?

04:43.720 --> 04:46.300
Karaoke

04:46.600 --> 04:51.090
Leave it to me! I, Reigen Arataka,
shall accept this job!

04:51.090 --> 04:54.180
I shall successfully get rid of this spirit!

04:55.560 --> 04:59.350
Live or not, this is still a TV show.

04:59.350 --> 05:02.580
It's all a setup written by some scriptwriter.

05:03.190 --> 05:04.790
If I do some random exorcism,

05:04.790 --> 05:07.730
that'll quietly be the cue
for the boy to calm down

05:07.730 --> 05:09.610
and the studio audience to clap.

05:09.950 --> 05:13.340
Then the host will praise me,
and the show will be over.

05:21.590 --> 05:23.710
Splashity Splash

05:21.900 --> 05:23.710
Salt Splash!

05:23.880 --> 05:27.180
And he just started throwing
a ton of salt outta nowhere!

05:27.670 --> 05:30.640
The spirit possessing the boy
seems to be struggling in agony.

05:30.640 --> 05:33.100
It's working! It's really working!

05:33.430 --> 05:36.140
But it has never worked before!

05:36.430 --> 05:38.810
This kid is acting!

05:39.130 --> 05:43.280
Now that I know that,
I'm not pulling any punches!

05:44.170 --> 05:47.200
Sorcery Crush Special!

05:47.400 --> 05:49.650
Air Banishing Salt...

05:50.020 --> 05:51.620
Punch!

05:51.620 --> 05:54.080
A clean hit!

05:54.590 --> 05:58.840
Well, it's been about 30 minutes
since the exorcism started,

05:58.840 --> 06:01.880
but apparently, the spirit
just refuses to leave.

06:01.880 --> 06:04.120
Talk about resilient.

06:02.290 --> 06:04.120
Evil Spirit Detox Acupressure!

06:04.120 --> 06:05.340
Holy Water Chop!

06:05.480 --> 06:07.240
For real!

06:07.240 --> 06:09.600
I've already used up all my special moves

06:07.550 --> 06:11.760
Sorcery Crush

06:07.550 --> 06:11.760
Aroma Runway Express

06:07.550 --> 06:11.760
Salt Splash

06:07.550 --> 06:11.760
Graphic Exorcism

06:07.880 --> 06:11.760
Hypnosis Punch

06:09.600 --> 06:11.760
and now I'm trying to keep
things going with ad-libs!

06:09.760 --> 06:11.760
Banishing Salt Punch

06:10.090 --> 06:11.760
Cheeseburger Tornado

06:11.010 --> 06:11.760
Anti-Possession Jumping Knee Strike

06:11.900 --> 06:14.520
All right, let's have our
other psychic step in.

06:14.520 --> 06:15.260
Huh?

06:15.260 --> 06:18.140
Jodo Kirin-sensei, if you would.

06:20.760 --> 06:23.440
W-Wait... Was I just an opening act?

06:23.440 --> 06:25.650
Is he going to take all the glory?!

06:25.960 --> 06:28.360
Hang on a sec. I've almost got it.

06:28.360 --> 06:30.410
Switching right now would be—

06:30.410 --> 06:32.200
Look, we're live.

06:34.130 --> 06:36.910
Reigen-kun, good work the last 30 minutes.

06:37.580 --> 06:39.420
You wily, scheming old man!

06:39.420 --> 06:42.750
All right, Jodo-sensei! Let's see you work!

06:42.930 --> 06:45.750
My spotlight!

06:45.990 --> 06:49.900
What am I supposed to exorcise here?
This boy isn't even possessed.

06:49.900 --> 06:50.970
He's just acting.

06:50.970 --> 06:51.990
Huh?

06:50.970 --> 06:51.990
S
a
y
w
h
a
?

06:53.800 --> 06:56.890
Oh, come on, you geezer!
Get a clue!

06:56.890 --> 06:59.860
Why'd you ruin all that setup
the program built up for you?!

06:59.860 --> 07:01.990
You are absolutely correct!

07:01.990 --> 07:04.610
I'm impressed you were able to see the truth

07:04.610 --> 07:07.070
when everyone in the studio has
been tricked this whole time!

07:07.070 --> 07:14.370
A true psychic has just been revealed!

07:16.140 --> 07:19.880
My name is Fukuda Suzuo, and I'm a child
actor from the Mongolian Spot Agency!

07:19.880 --> 07:22.280
That was some brilliant acting!

07:22.280 --> 07:23.670
Thank you very much!

07:24.030 --> 07:26.700
I could barely tell he was acting!

07:26.700 --> 07:29.680
Sci-fi researcher, Mogi-san,
what did you think?

07:29.860 --> 07:33.340
I'd like to ask that gentleman over there

07:33.340 --> 07:35.640
what all that "exorcism" crap was about.

07:36.140 --> 07:39.600
What were you doing to a spirit
that didn't even exist?

07:39.860 --> 07:43.810
Reigen-sensei, I'm sure our viewers
are wondering that as well.

07:45.910 --> 07:48.570
Could it be... that you actually
don't have spiritual powers?

07:50.180 --> 07:54.460
Come, now. Let's just say
this is how he works.

07:54.460 --> 07:56.850
Excellent work, Jodo-sensei!

07:56.850 --> 08:01.050
It should've been completely obvious
if the boy was possessed or not...

08:01.050 --> 08:03.170
If you're a true psychic, that is.

08:03.480 --> 08:05.000
Oh, I beg your pardon.

08:05.000 --> 08:08.340
It's not like I'm referring to Reigen-san.

08:08.340 --> 08:12.170
I'm sure he was trying to liven things
up for the sake of the program.

08:12.170 --> 08:15.000
But I can guarantee that we
didn't ask him to do that.

08:15.000 --> 08:19.040
What? Really? Poor Fukuda-kun.

08:19.040 --> 08:20.810
It was basically torture.

08:20.810 --> 08:24.020
Then what in the world were
you doing for 30 minutes?

08:24.020 --> 08:25.650
Some new kind of dance?

08:27.160 --> 08:31.000
I mean... It appeared as though that
boy was possessed by some spirit...

08:31.000 --> 08:32.750
So I exorcised it.

08:32.750 --> 08:35.030
Even if he was merely acting
like he was possessed,

08:35.030 --> 08:37.070
spirits could come by at any moment.

08:37.070 --> 08:41.100
What? A spirit was here?
I didn't even notice.

08:41.100 --> 08:42.660
When did it appear?

08:43.810 --> 08:44.870
About 30 minutes ago...

08:44.870 --> 08:47.920
Right on the dot! I never knew
evil spirits were so punctual!

08:51.660 --> 08:54.840
What kind of spirit was it? Huh?
What kind of spirit was it?

08:55.180 --> 08:56.550
It was a man...

08:57.030 --> 08:59.510
I think he was German...

08:59.790 --> 09:03.540
Stop it, me! If you say another word...

09:05.620 --> 09:06.900
It was Beethoven.

09:06.900 --> 09:10.770
Du-du-du-dunnn!

09:08.860 --> 09:11.440
n

09:12.420 --> 09:14.440
Did you watch yesterday's ep
of Supernatural Detective?

09:14.440 --> 09:16.410
I did! I laughed so hard!

