Anonymous Table Salt

09:18.010 --> 09:20.110
That Reigen guy is hilarious!

09:18.370 --> 09:19.410
Herf lol

09:18.370 --> 09:19.660
What is this?

09:18.370 --> 09:19.870
Crazy Salt Splash

09:18.370 --> 09:20.160
Hilarious

09:18.370 --> 09:20.370
Con Man

09:18.370 --> 09:20.830
lolololololololololololololol

09:18.370 --> 09:20.830
Exorcism dance

09:18.370 --> 09:20.830
He's finished lololol

09:18.370 --> 09:20.830
Desperate lololol

09:18.370 --> 09:20.830
S-lol-A-lol-L-lol-T S-lol-P-lol-L-lol-A-lol-S-lol-H

09:18.370 --> 09:20.830
Who is this?

09:19.280 --> 09:20.830
Oh shit lololololol

09:21.060 --> 09:23.910
Looks like Reigen's dug
himself into a hole...

09:23.910 --> 09:26.420
Naritasan

09:24.270 --> 09:26.420
There's no way that guy's a fraud.

09:26.590 --> 09:30.060
I wonder if Reigen-san has
a plan to get out of this.

09:30.780 --> 09:32.750
They're apparently making
a group for his victims.

09:32.750 --> 09:34.040
Wanna go?

09:34.040 --> 09:36.380
But we're not victims, though.

09:36.650 --> 09:38.710
So he was a con artist after all.

09:38.710 --> 09:41.260
It's probably his fault
we aren't getting any job offers.

09:41.420 --> 09:44.220
I knew there was something off about him.

09:44.490 --> 09:47.260
I'm gonna feed the media
even more bullcrap about him!

09:47.940 --> 09:49.940
The Next Day

09:50.310 --> 09:52.620
Hey, I might just be remembering wrong,

09:52.620 --> 09:57.100
but isn't the place you work called
Spirits and Such Consultation Office?

09:57.100 --> 09:58.070
It is.

09:58.070 --> 10:02.390
Th-Then is your master's name...
Reigen Arataka?

10:02.390 --> 10:03.790
Huh? Yeah, it is.

10:03.790 --> 10:05.900
Y-You haven't heard?

10:05.900 --> 10:10.450
Your master's getting bashed like crazy
on TV and the Internet!

10:12.650 --> 10:15.800
We're getting a lot more actual jobs now.

10:15.800 --> 10:17.430
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

10:15.800 --> 10:17.430
The star psychic of the 21st century
who defeated Ohiki-san

10:15.800 --> 10:17.430
Welcome to
Reigen Arataka's
homepage!

10:15.800 --> 10:20.130
If I become famous, I might be able to
break through to other media platforms.

10:21.800 --> 10:24.440
That's all part of his plan.

10:24.930 --> 10:26.890
We're closed today

10:26.890 --> 10:30.650
Unknown

10:29.180 --> 10:31.340
Did he really think people
wouldn't find out?

10:31.340 --> 10:33.020
And he calls himself a spirit medium?

10:33.020 --> 10:35.440
I've actually been a victim
of spiritual fraud myself.

10:35.440 --> 10:38.280
The "Self-Proclaimed" Psychic. Isn't He a Fraud?

10:35.720 --> 10:38.280
They wanted to undress for an exorcism.

10:42.370 --> 10:44.660
God damn it! I was set up!

10:44.660 --> 10:46.820
Those conniving bastards!

10:46.820 --> 10:50.290
They used me as a scapegoat to boost
their ratings for like 30 seconds?!

10:50.510 --> 10:52.960
That conniving old man!

10:53.190 --> 10:57.130
For now, I need to contain this and ensure
I don't become an even bigger meme.

10:55.920 --> 10:57.920
Anonymous Table Salt
\h\h\h\hDat name tho lololololololololololol

10:55.920 --> 10:57.920
Anonymous Table Salt
\h\h\h\hReigen's the real deal.
\h\h\h\hHe's actually performed an exorcism on me, and my
\h\h\h\hshoulders and back feel so much lighter now.
\h\h\h\hI felt better immediately.

10:58.010 --> 10:58.880
Anonymous Table Salt
\h\h\h\hI bet that's Reigen, isn't it?

10:58.880 --> 11:00.870
Gah! They figured me out!

