Criminal
Anonymous Table Salt

11:04.470 --> 11:05.600
Okay, Rüppell's fox

11:05.720 --> 11:06.850
Get lost, you fraud
Anonymous Table Salt

11:05.720 --> 11:06.850
Do you even realize you're a criminal?

11:06.970 --> 11:08.100
Reigen's watching~

11:08.230 --> 11:09.480
I found Reigen's high school graduation photo lolol

11:09.730 --> 11:11.810
Is that how it's gonna be,
you little bastards?

11:11.810 --> 11:16.820
Like I'd let a bunch of little shits who
don't know a thing about hard work beat me!

11:17.640 --> 11:20.310
But the title and reputation of
"scam artist psychic"

11:20.310 --> 11:24.030
spread like wildfire across media platforms
like a game of telephone.

11:24.030 --> 11:29.780
And in three days, being the ultimate evil
had basically become Reigen's public image.

11:29.780 --> 11:30.830
You can't be serious!

11:30.830 --> 11:32.910
This isn't true at all!

11:32.910 --> 11:36.700
How dare they spread these lies about me?

11:35.630 --> 11:38.130
Self-Proclaimed New Star of the Psychic World
Reigen: The Scam Artist Psychic
His Unbelievably Bold Tricks!!!

11:41.010 --> 11:42.890
Happy Trails

11:41.660 --> 11:42.890
So basically,

11:43.130 --> 11:47.320
I need you guys all to be my witnesses to
stop these guys from calling me a fraud.

11:47.650 --> 11:49.780
All you have to do is talk to the media.

11:50.680 --> 11:51.430
Huh?

11:51.980 --> 11:54.310
Hey, why aren't you being
as annoying as usual?

11:54.310 --> 11:56.260
Leave, now.

11:56.260 --> 11:58.280
You can't fool us anymore.

11:58.280 --> 11:59.410
Huh?

11:59.410 --> 12:01.240
Hey, you can't be serious!

12:01.240 --> 12:04.870
You probably thought we were prime prey!

12:04.870 --> 12:06.740
We're not falling for that!

12:06.740 --> 12:10.450
And here I thought he was a little cute, too!

12:10.880 --> 12:15.550
Well, I guess the only thing I can do now
is wait until this all blows over.

12:16.170 --> 12:19.220
What the heck? Are they actually
staking out my place?

12:20.520 --> 12:22.170
There he is! That's Reigen Arataka!

12:22.340 --> 12:23.380
Shit!

12:23.380 --> 12:23.920
Don't run away!

12:23.920 --> 12:24.470
Wait!

12:24.470 --> 12:27.200
What was that so-called exorcism
you performed on that show?

12:27.200 --> 12:30.320
Don't you think you need
to explain yourself?

12:30.320 --> 12:31.970
You could at least give us some answers!

12:31.970 --> 12:33.660
Are you off today?

12:33.660 --> 12:36.190
The people aren't going to
be satisfied with this!

12:36.410 --> 12:38.590
Everyone has their eye on you!

12:38.210 --> 12:39.150
Yeah!

12:38.590 --> 12:40.050
You can't run from this!

12:39.150 --> 12:40.350
A press conference!

12:39.470 --> 12:41.340
How about holding a press conference?

12:41.340 --> 12:41.900
Huh?

12:42.650 --> 12:44.050
A press conference?

12:45.850 --> 12:48.280
Reigen Arataka, the man
who's garnered attention

12:48.280 --> 12:50.680
for allegedly conning people
with psychic scams,

12:50.680 --> 12:53.210
announced that he will be holding
a press conference tomorrow.

12:53.210 --> 12:55.890
We believe the subjects that
will be discussed will include

12:53.210 --> 12:57.040
Alleged Psychic Scammer

12:53.210 --> 12:57.040
Plans to Hold a Press Conference

12:53.210 --> 12:57.040
Reigen Arataka

12:55.890 --> 12:58.140
if his previous activities
were indeed illegal,

12:58.140 --> 13:00.120
and if he actually even
possesses spiritual powers.

12:58.800 --> 12:59.850
That's...

13:04.880 --> 13:06.340
To Arataka – From Mom

13:04.880 --> 13:06.340
I'll show you a top secret way to...

13:07.260 --> 13:10.720
You seem to be in a lot of trouble.
I prepared an apology for you to say at the press conference,
so if you get in trouble, just read that.
Learn your lesson from this,
quit this scamming business, and get a real job.
I know your dad doesn't say it much, but he's worried about you.
You should come home. You haven't been home lately at all.
This is the perfect opportunity for us to all have a family meeting.
I'm on your side.

13:12.980 --> 13:14.390
Apology

13:14.310 --> 13:15.440
Thank you all for gathering here today.
I'm sorry that you all had to take the time
to show up today over my own personal actions.
First of all, I'd like to apologize to all the people I've troubled,
as well as to all of their friends and family members I may have burdened.
I'd like to take this opportunity to formally apologize to everyone.
I'm so terribly sorry for everything I've done.
(Now, bow. Hold for 2 minutes.)

13:15.440 --> 13:17.810
(1 day ago)

13:18.320 --> 13:21.580
Man... It'll be morning soon.

13:22.440 --> 13:25.950
Mob Psycho

13:25.950 --> 13:27.110
Mob Psycho

13:32.410 --> 13:32.990
He's here!

13:32.990 --> 13:34.370
Reigen has appeared!

13:43.230 --> 13:44.600
Damn, that's bright.

13:44.960 --> 13:45.800
Shit.

13:46.530 --> 13:50.140
I thought I'd have a chance if
we were just going to argue,

13:50.420 --> 13:52.600
but now my head's completely blank.

13:53.250 --> 13:54.670
Calm down.

13:54.670 --> 13:57.810
First, you need to get the reporters
to have a good impression of you.

13:58.070 --> 14:01.170
F-First, I'd like to thank
you all for gathering...

14:07.270 --> 14:09.070
Why did you all gather here today, anyway?

14:09.630 --> 14:13.080
It's pretty common to suddenly get tired
of all this shit at the last minute.

14:13.080 --> 14:14.280
What's with that attitude?!

14:14.280 --> 14:15.080
What?!

14:15.080 --> 14:16.420
Are you mocking us?!

14:16.420 --> 14:18.580
You're the one who said you'd
hold a press conference!

14:19.020 --> 14:21.630
That's because you guys kept
stalking me to my house.

14:21.630 --> 14:24.210
You basically made me hold this thing.

14:24.890 --> 14:28.340
I have a few questions regarding
the fraudulent acts you've committed.

14:28.510 --> 14:29.870
Hang on a sec.

14:29.870 --> 14:32.300
By "fraudulent acts," are you
referring to my business?

14:32.620 --> 14:37.460
Is there anyone here that can actually prove
I don't have any spiritual powers?

14:37.460 --> 14:40.770
Or maybe any victims who can
prove they've been scammed?

14:40.940 --> 14:43.480
There are a lot of people who've
reported that they've been scammed—

14:43.630 --> 14:45.320
Right. Self-proclaimed "victims."

14:45.620 --> 14:47.530
Why are you saying it like that?!

14:47.860 --> 14:50.230
Because it hasn't been proven.

14:50.380 --> 14:53.980
Unless and until they are,
I can still call myself a psychic.

14:53.980 --> 14:55.200
I'm not a criminal.

14:55.530 --> 14:57.660
I'd be careful with how you
phrase things if I were you.

14:58.780 --> 15:00.170
All right, I have a question.

15:00.350 --> 15:01.410
Go ahead.

15:01.410 --> 15:03.890
Do you actually have spiritual powers?

15:03.890 --> 15:05.630
No comment.

15:05.630 --> 15:07.420
Recording

15:05.850 --> 15:07.420
Why won't you answer?

15:07.910 --> 15:11.240
Because you won't be satisfied
unless I say "no."

15:11.240 --> 15:14.640
I can't prove that I have spiritual powers
since you all lack them yourselves.

15:14.640 --> 15:18.180
Are you really going to try
to talk your way out of this?

15:18.180 --> 15:20.550
Judging from the broadcast the other day,

15:20.550 --> 15:23.010
you do seem like you're
excellent at ad-libbing.

15:23.820 --> 15:24.480
Tch.

15:25.150 --> 15:27.410
Oh? Did you just click your tongue?

15:27.410 --> 15:29.780
No, I was just testing the mics.

15:29.780 --> 15:32.740
Potato Chips

15:29.780 --> 15:35.490
Cola

15:30.110 --> 15:32.850
Uh-oh, now he's copping an attitude.

15:32.850 --> 15:34.620
This guy's finished.

15:35.490 --> 15:36.280
TekeTekeFanClub@gakkokaidan  –7 minutes ago

15:35.490 --> 15:36.280
Mic test                                 #PressConference

15:35.490 --> 15:38.790
Press Conference

15:35.490 --> 15:38.790
Popular               All tweets                        Users        Pictures      Videos           News

15:35.920 --> 15:38.790
When did you start this
psychic business of yours?

15:36.490 --> 15:37.790
Level of sorry: 0
What's the criminal getting all pissy for? Lololol
#PressConference

15:38.040 --> 15:38.790
Mic test lolololol                                         #PressConference

15:38.080 --> 15:38.790
IDrinkPufferfish@usotsuki_usouso  –20 seconds ago

15:39.100 --> 15:40.720
About four years ago.

15:40.720 --> 15:42.440
What were you doing prior to that?

15:42.820 --> 15:44.290
I worked at some company.

15:44.730 --> 15:47.230
Did that company have anything
to do with psychics?

15:47.230 --> 15:48.870
No, not at all.

15:49.440 --> 15:50.970
He's actually answering the questions.

15:51.650 --> 15:54.210
What kind of problems did
people come to you with?

15:54.210 --> 15:57.530
Stiff shoulders, spirit photos, and stuff.

15:57.530 --> 15:59.330
Did they see any results?

15:59.330 --> 16:00.850
Those cases have been solved.

16:00.850 --> 16:04.180
Any particular case that stands out?

16:04.180 --> 16:05.810
Getting rid of some urban legends.

16:06.340 --> 16:08.730
Have you ever had any
conflicts with your clients?

16:08.730 --> 16:09.540
I have not.

16:09.540 --> 16:12.550
Have you ever sold any expensive
salt or prayer beads?

16:12.550 --> 16:13.950
I have not.

16:13.950 --> 16:17.730
Apparently, information about when you were
a student is spreading over the Internet.

16:17.730 --> 16:18.950
That doesn't matter.

16:19.330 --> 16:23.230
According to your graduation
essay, you wrote this...

16:23.230 --> 16:24.670
"I want to be somebody."

16:29.430 --> 16:32.550
What made you get into the psychic business?

16:35.370 --> 16:37.050
Why?

16:37.390 --> 16:39.890
Reigen-san looks pretty pale...

16:40.050 --> 16:43.100
D-Don't keep making the
media outlets your enemy.

16:43.260 --> 16:46.060
How wonderful. He's at a loss for words.

16:46.450 --> 16:49.110
Something's wrong.
He doesn't have his usual zing.

16:49.430 --> 16:51.120
Great Master Reigen...

16:51.120 --> 16:52.320
What's wrong?

16:52.900 --> 16:56.530
Why did I decide to live as a psychic?

16:57.040 --> 17:00.330
It's not like it's lucrative,
and it's usually troublesome.

17:00.690 --> 17:02.180
Thinking back,

17:01.410 --> 17:02.700
Clincity

17:01.410 --> 17:02.700
Super delicious!
The next generation

17:01.410 --> 17:02.700
water dispenser

17:01.410 --> 17:02.700
The ultimate
natural spring
water to keep
you healthy

17:02.180 --> 17:04.330
there was a time when
I always did everything efficiently

17:04.490 --> 17:07.210
and was filled with curiosity
about everything.

17:07.750 --> 17:11.920
But then I got bored, quit my job,
and rented that office on a whim.

17:12.760 --> 17:17.470
I ended up getting into this facade of a
job because of an ad I saw in a magazine.

17:13.670 --> 17:15.130
Power Stone

17:13.670 --> 17:15.130
You can become a
millionaire, too!!

17:18.110 --> 17:21.740
That's right... I actually
meant to quit a long time ago.

17:22.100 --> 17:25.350
3
Years
Ago

17:22.100 --> 17:25.350
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

17:23.380 --> 17:25.350
Thank you very much!

17:25.540 --> 17:28.270
My body felt so heavy,
but now I'm fine!

17:30.630 --> 17:32.570
Man, I'm bored.

17:32.570 --> 17:35.510
As it stands, I'm no
different from a masseur.

17:35.510 --> 17:37.280
Guess it's about time to wrap things up.

17:39.320 --> 17:40.910
I wonder what I should do next.

17:41.220 --> 17:43.560
Being a PI sounds pretty fun,

17:43.560 --> 17:47.000
but maybe not, since apparently they mostly
do investigations on cheating spouses.

17:48.120 --> 17:49.470
Excuse me.

17:49.470 --> 17:51.470
I came here because I saw your sign.

17:51.470 --> 17:52.600
Sure thing.

17:53.070 --> 17:54.510
How may I help you?

17:54.510 --> 17:56.550
Er... Oh, it's just a kid.

17:57.550 --> 17:59.630
What do you want, boy?

17:59.630 --> 18:02.010
Um, I'm an esper.

18:02.550 --> 18:03.560
Wha?

18:03.560 --> 18:06.620
There are times when I can't
control my powers very well,

18:06.620 --> 18:07.790
and it's scary.

18:07.790 --> 18:10.620
You shitty little brat.
This must be a prank.

18:11.010 --> 18:14.070
Did someone tell you to
come here and tell me that?

18:14.230 --> 18:17.330
No. I haven't been able to
talk to anyone about this.

18:17.330 --> 18:20.990
I thought you might be the same as me...

18:21.190 --> 18:23.450
If I tried, I could see spirits, too.

18:23.970 --> 18:27.410
A pathological liar?
No, maybe it's an overactive imagination.

18:28.000 --> 18:32.000
Either way, he seems rather troubled by this.

18:32.900 --> 18:34.470
Well, come on in.

18:35.810 --> 18:36.720
Okay.

18:38.130 --> 18:40.550
I was troubled a lot when I was a kid, too.

18:42.000 --> 18:43.350
What's with this kid?

18:43.760 --> 18:45.930
He's staring at me with
eyes brimming with hope.

18:45.930 --> 18:47.930
This is serious.

18:47.930 --> 18:50.890
This kid's in his own fantasy world.

18:50.890 --> 18:52.820
I'll just come up with something
to get him to go home.

18:53.770 --> 18:57.250
Listen. Just because you have psychic powers

18:57.250 --> 18:59.700
doesn't make you any less human.

19:00.080 --> 19:02.180
It's the same as people who are fast,
people who are book smart,

19:02.180 --> 19:04.140
and people with strong body odor.

19:04.140 --> 19:07.210
Psychic powers are just
another characteristic.

19:08.160 --> 19:12.740
You must embrace that as a part of
yourself and continue to live positively.

19:13.060 --> 19:15.630
The truth behind one's charm is kindness.

19:16.000 --> 19:18.590
Become a good person. That is all.

19:20.220 --> 19:22.550
May I come to talk to you again?

19:22.780 --> 19:26.260
Yeah, I don't know about that.
I'm pretty busy, you know?

19:26.260 --> 19:28.520
Anyway, you should go home for tod— Hot!

19:28.790 --> 19:29.980
Hey, don't get bur—

19:35.070 --> 19:40.030
Hey... You said you could
see ghosts, too, right?

19:41.550 --> 19:43.920
Do you know how to exorcise them, too?

19:46.980 --> 19:49.410
All right. Come again tomorrow
around the same time.

19:49.410 --> 19:50.910
What? Really?

19:51.220 --> 19:53.920
I'll show you how to use your powers.

19:55.960 --> 20:00.050
Back then, I couldn't help but admire
this kid that walked into my life.

20:00.890 --> 20:03.040
I wanted to grasp something for myself, too.

20:03.710 --> 20:05.930
I wanted to become someone special.

20:07.430 --> 20:09.390
Yet this is the result.

20:10.060 --> 20:12.870
I haven't changed at all since then.

20:12.870 --> 20:15.470
I just kept using him.

20:15.980 --> 20:19.190
In the end, I couldn't become anything.

20:19.910 --> 20:24.860
Maybe I was the one who was holding
him back from his youth the most.

20:26.040 --> 20:28.580
Man, I said something really awful back then.

20:29.330 --> 20:33.170
He wanted to change,
and yet I tried to cage him in.

20:37.620 --> 20:41.120
Hey, Mob... Are you watching?

20:39.460 --> 20:40.710
Karaoke

20:42.220 --> 20:44.010
# Reigen Arataka
58,699 tweets

20:50.730 --> 20:53.410
You've grown up so much. You know that?

20:55.840 --> 20:57.190
That doesn't answer anything!

20:57.190 --> 20:58.150
What kind of answer is that?!

20:58.150 --> 20:59.720
What was that silence?

20:59.720 --> 21:00.890
Who was that message to?

21:00.890 --> 21:02.080
We don't understand!

21:02.080 --> 21:03.580
Answer us!

21:04.720 --> 21:06.030
It's an earthquake!

21:07.890 --> 21:11.000
We are experiencing an extremely
powerful earthquake!

21:11.000 --> 21:11.490
Psychics exist.
Says the psychic #Press

21:11.000 --> 21:11.490
