21:11.000 --> 21:11.490
So cool                  #PressConference

21:11.540 --> 21:12.250
Tsuchi @tsutiku0 –35 seconds ago

21:11.540 --> 21:12.250
Anacatesthesia FTW #PressConference

21:11.540 --> 21:12.250
ThrowAway303 @nagee566 –41 seconds ago

21:11.540 --> 21:12.250
I feel the power    #PressConference

21:12.330 --> 21:12.960
Che @0015putfesee –23 seconds ago

21:12.330 --> 21:12.960
CG technology is getting incredible lately  #Press

21:13.140 --> 21:15.060
Where's this press conference being held?

21:16.550 --> 21:18.170
O-Our cameras!

21:18.170 --> 21:21.630
Spirit

21:18.490 --> 21:21.630
I-Is Reigen doing this?!

21:21.630 --> 21:22.850
Telekinesis?!

21:22.850 --> 21:24.300
Such incredible power!

21:24.300 --> 21:26.680
Naritasan

21:24.530 --> 21:26.680
That doesn't seem like Reigen-san.

21:26.920 --> 21:29.300
This is getting serious...

21:29.780 --> 21:31.570
Nii-san! Nii-san!

21:32.040 --> 21:34.600
How can you remain so calm?!

21:34.600 --> 21:36.980
Are you the one doing this?!

21:37.210 --> 21:39.160
P-Please do something!

21:39.160 --> 21:40.980
Is this due to your spiritual powers?

21:42.700 --> 21:45.700
Gee, I wonder what's going on.

21:45.700 --> 21:47.270
Please, stop this!

21:47.270 --> 21:48.930
What the hell's going on?!

21:49.260 --> 21:51.160
Are you done asking me if I'm a fraud or not?

21:53.590 --> 21:56.620
In that case, I'll be ending
this press conference.

21:56.620 --> 21:57.810
H-Hey!

21:57.810 --> 21:59.340
What's going to happen to us?!

21:59.560 --> 22:00.600
Beats me.

22:00.600 --> 22:03.900
You should probably concentrate
on finding your next big story.

22:10.440 --> 22:12.140
One of the lights fell!

22:12.140 --> 22:14.890
One moment please

22:14.890 --> 22:18.600
Cola

22:15.200 --> 22:17.760
What the hell was that? Such bullshit.

22:18.600 --> 22:21.730
Cornered
~True Identity~

22:35.100 --> 22:37.920
Why... are you here?

22:38.940 --> 22:40.170
Just because.

22:40.780 --> 22:45.170
Let's get the hell out of here.
They're gonna be running around for a while.

22:50.630 --> 22:53.760
Hey... Do you know?

22:54.180 --> 22:55.920
Know what?

22:55.920 --> 22:57.520
What I really am...

22:58.110 --> 23:00.310
Haven't you seen any of the stuff
on the web or magazines?

23:01.600 --> 23:04.910
I've always known... from the beginning.

23:07.840 --> 23:10.980
What my master really is...

23:16.520 --> 23:17.790
is a genuinely good guy.

23:38.320 --> 23:39.520
Man, I'm starving.

23:39.980 --> 23:41.880
Let's have some ramen and head home.

23:41.880 --> 23:42.650
Okay.

23:44.960 --> 23:49.450
Oh, by the way, Master, happy birthday.

23:55.610 --> 23:58.120
Mob's finally telling Tsubomi-chan
how he really feels about her?

23:58.120 --> 24:00.910
And he's going to try to place
within the top 10 in a marathon?

24:00.910 --> 24:02.920
Welp, looks like he's going to need my help.

24:03.310 --> 24:05.540
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 II Episode 8:

24:05.540 --> 24:06.920
"Even Then ~Continue Forward~."

24:06.920 --> 24:09.480
First-press limited edition?
That is the absolute best decision.

24:06.920 --> 24:10.210
Even Then
~Continue Forward~
